        "TileImage": "$($repository 1e142575-830c-4e58-8bdb-8d39b613e406).Image",
        "Description": "47, it&apos;s Chewsday innit? We need rugs to hide bodies. Annoying saleswoman won&apos;t sell store but her husband will. Take her out and store her in the box in her shop. Do not harm the husband. Also take out the politician and her guard on the roof so nothing can be traced back to us. Good Luck 47.\r\rCreator - whopTbird",
